  <data name="Home.StartNow" xml:space="preserve"><value>Get Started</value></data>
  <data name="Home.Features.QuickStart.Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Quick Setup</value></data>
  <data name="Home.Features.QuickStart.Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Use the framework template for one-click installation.</value></data>
  <data name="Home.Features.AiNative.Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>AI-Native Framework</value></data>
  <data name="Home.Features.AiNative.Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Build systems with AI for a smarter development experience, with integrated AI capabilities that make AI applications easy to create.</value></data>
  <data name="Home.Features.Modular.Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Modular Design</value></data>
  <data name="Home.Features.Modular.Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Combine and extend highly modular components freely. Every module can be developed, tested, integrated, and deployed independently.</value></data>
  <data name="Home.Features.Databases.Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Multiple Databases</value></data>
  <data name="Home.Features.Databases.Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Supports SQL Server, MySQL, SQLite, PostgreSQL, Oracle, DM (Dameng), and more, with straightforward extensibility.</value></data>
  <data name="Home.Features.Performance.Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>High Performance</value></data>
  <data name="Home.Features.Performance.Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>More than 10 years of enterprise optimization expertise delivers high performance and availability, proven by systems serving over 5 million page views per day.</value></data>
  <data name="Home.Features.Ddd.Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>DDD Architecture</value></data>
  <data name="Home.Features.Ddd.Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Built with a rigorous Domain-Driven Design approach to adapt flexibly to change.</value></data>
  <data name="Home.Features.Dapr.Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Dapr Support</value></data>
  <data name="Home.Features.Dapr.Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Supports the Dapr framework for rapidly building microservices.</value></data>
  <data name="Home.Features.Compatibility.Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Backward Compatible</value></data>
  <data name="Home.Features.Compatibility.Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Alongside microservices and distributed systems, NCF supports traditional and standalone deployments with no extra learning curve. Its modular architecture enables seamless upgrades.</value></data>
  <data name="Home.Features.Community.Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Community Support</value></data>
  <data name="Home.Features.Community.Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Maintained and continuously upgraded by the core Senparc developer community team.</value></data>
